{"_meta":{"ui":{"resourceUri":"ui://whenship/app.html"},"ui/resourceUri":"ui://whenship/app.html"},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Show plan"},"description":"Schedules work for a small team and shows an interactive Gantt chart: finish dates per item, deadline risk (on time / tight / late, with a rough chance), what sets the end date, and the best options to meet more deadlines. Use for \"when will this ship\", \"can we make these deadlines\", prioritising several projects or clients, and capacity planning. Input: people or teams (lanes) and items in priority order with effort in working days. Returns a text summary plus the chart, which the user edits directly. `changes` apply edits first (the answer compares before and after); `suggestions` are options of your own (title + changes), each measured exactly and shown in the chart for the user to apply.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"changes":{"description":"Edits to apply first, in order (same format as what_if)","items":{"oneOf":[{"properties":{"item":{"type":"string"},"op":{"const":"move","type":"string"},"to":{"description":"New 1-based position","type":"number"}},"required":["op","item","to"],"type":"object"},{"properties":{"days":{"type":"number"},"item":{"type":"string"},"lane":{"type":"string"},"op":{"const":"setEffort","type":"string"}},"required":["op","item","lane","days"],"type":"object"},{"properties":{"date":{"anyOf":[{"description":"Calendar date, YYYY-MM-DD","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"item":{"type":"string"},"op":{"const":"setDeadline","type":"string"}},"required":["op","item","date"],"type":"object"},{"properties":{"date":{"anyOf":[{"description":"Calendar date, YYYY-MM-DD","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Waiting on something external until this date; null clears it"},"item":{"type":"string"},"op":{"const":"setNotBefore","type":"string"}},"re